  "readability_rules": [
    "Remains never participate in collision or pathfinding.",
    "XP uses a separate luminous layer and remains visible above aftermath.",
    "No decorative object may cover the hero, enemy silhouette or danger telegraph.",
    "The player must be able to circle a wave through the open field without a forced corridor.",
    "The camera sector is not the world boundary.",
    "A mobile preview must show at least three independent environmental reactions."
  ]
